{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/9079ea870e8076444d2bcec43407332d.avif?t=1758058502\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through different environments of procedural levels guarded by gods and fight off hordes of enemies with the build that matches your playstyle. Save the inhabitants and expand the city as you progress, this unlocks new shops and tools in the city as the shopkeepers return home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/7e8f05ef6b2826ac087d917d9b10410b.poster.avif?t=1758058502\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/7e8f05ef6b2826ac087d917d9b10410b.webm?t=1758058502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/7e8f05ef6b2826ac087d917d9b10410b.mp4?t=1758058502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/8cd4244d07d879790ee0f6c40e56fd80.avif?t=1758058502\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a variety of stackable items and use them to create a build in your playstyle. Try different combinations to create new strategies and adapt to whatever challenges each run throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/650ebaf2fc5823afb1a6a8b9ade72349.poster.avif?t=1758058502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/650ebaf2fc5823afb1a6a8b9ade72349.webm?t=1758058502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/650ebaf2fc5823afb1a6a8b9ade72349.mp4?t=1758058502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/extras/eb29facf39dce5b341ecfe1a14b5adc5.webp?t=1758058502\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Hemlock is falling apart and the realm has been overtaken by the corruption of hell, it\u2019s up to you to save the city and its inhabitants  and in return they might give you the help you need to survive the chaos,<br><br>Face challenging bosses with their own unique abilities and attack patterns. Learn how they fight, adapt your strategy, and defeat them to earn new rewards and unlock more areas of the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2851550?t=1758058502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2851550?t=1758058502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/e3f900521bbe34e01a6f6238fb5fa78ded125c73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758058502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851550/e3f900521bbe34e01a6f6238fb5fa78ded125c73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758058502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence, slaying demons"},"demos":[{"appid":2949040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr